# vermagic.pin — exact vermagic string modules check at load (ch.03 §41 step 3).
# Builder regenerates per build (out/<sku>/abi-current/vermagic.txt) and CI diffs
# against this pin; mismatch = modules silently refuse at factory (§24 smoke).
# Format: <release> SMP preempt mod_unload aarch64 (exact `modinfo -F vermagic` output).
6.6.30 SMP preempt mod_unload aarch64
